# Sound Effects Directory

Place your sound effect files here with the following names:

- card-select.mp3 - Played when a card is selected
- card-reveal.mp3 - Played when cards are revealed
- round-win.mp3 - Played when you win a round
- round-lose.mp3 - Played when you lose a round
- round-draw.mp3 - Played when a round is a draw
- game-win.mp3 - Played when you win the game
- game-lose.mp3 - Played when you lose the game
- ready.mp3 - Played when the ready button is clicked
- room-join.mp3 - Played when joining/creating a room
- timer-warning.mp3 - Played when timer reaches 2 seconds

## Recommended Sound Sources

1. Free Sound Effects:
   - https://freesound.org/
   - https://www.zapsplat.com/
   - https://mixkit.co/free-sound-effects/

2. License: Make sure sounds are royalty-free or properly licensed

3. Format: MP3 format, keep files under 100KB for faster loading

4. Volume: Normalize sounds to -12dB to -6dB for consistent volume levels

